file: configparams.cpp
test: configSurvivesBinaryRoundTrip
why: an off-by-one in the serialize order misaligns the whole stream
--- from
    for (int i = 0;i < mSerializeOrder.size();i++) {
        getParamSerial(vb, mSerializeOrder.at(i));
    }
--- to
    for (int i = 1;i < mSerializeOrder.size();i++) {
        getParamSerial(vb, mSerializeOrder.at(i));
    }
